Calling the factory function set_type_override_by_type() (in bold above) instructs the
environment to use short-delay frames.
At times, a user may want to send special traffic to one interface but keep sending the regular traffic to other
interfaces. This can be achieved by using set_inst_override_by_type() inside an UVM
component.
