Some items to note from this example:
— The user-selected priority is passed to each sequence’s start(). The default priority is a value of
100. Higher values denote higher priority.
— The default arbitration scheme for uvm_sequencer i s SEQ_ARB_FIFO, which does not take
sequence priority into account. I t is critical that the sequenc er's arbitration scheme be changed to
either SEQ_ARB_STRICT_FIFO, SEQ_ARB_STRICT_RANDOM, or (if a user-defined arbitration
scheme is defined that takes priority into consideration) SEQ_ARB_USER.

