The following example has a covergroup, cg_def. It has three arguments, where two
arguments are used to guard ignore cross bins, bc2 and bd2, respectively, while the
third argument is used to set the option auto_bin_max for the coverpoints of the group.
Since the value of auto_bin_max impacts the bin space of the covergroup, the respective
