Line Coverage in Program Blocks
VCS calculates line coverage for executable lines in
program blocks
program blocks. Consider the
following example that shows the collection of line coverage for a program block, P:
Example 15 Line Coverage in Program Blocks
program P;
string s = "Hello";
$display(s.len());
s[2] = byte'(0);
$display(s.len());
end
endprogram
