GEN_FSM(1).FSM_MEM_P.FSM_COMBO_LOGIC_P.STATE
GEN_FSM(2).FSM_MEM_P.FSM_COMBO_LOGIC_P.STATE
GEN_FSM(3).FSM_MEM_P.FSM_COMBO_LOGIC_P.STATE
